        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A gentle 3D action adventure anyone can enjoy！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From kids playing their very first game to grown-ups who prefer something relaxing—anyone can enjoy Fruitimo! There’s no game over and no complicated controls. Just <strong>find, vacuum, and carry</strong> the fruits with simple, intuitive actions. Welcome to a colorful little world that feels warm and comforting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/9259577b5710e9b1dc70728726683b52.poster.avif?t=1787815683\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/9259577b5710e9b1dc70728726683b52.webm?t=1787815683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/9259577b5710e9b1dc70728726683b52.mp4?t=1787815683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the fun and mysterious Kajune Land!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>Vimita</strong>, a boy who loves fruits, and his backpack-shaped android <strong>Grandpa</strong>, as they head out on a big adventure to find giant fruits! There’s a juice river, sherbet hills, robots, drones, and even a giant slide! Fruits are hidden all over the place—look carefully and see what you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/2e2676e427d2e1b0aa0e6b4fa8537e90.poster.avif?t=1787815683\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/2e2676e427d2e1b0aa0e6b4fa8537e90.webm?t=1787815683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/2e2676e427d2e1b0aa0e6b4fa8537e90.mp4?t=1787815683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No game over, so you can relax and play at your own pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw jelly, vacuum fruits, or use the Search function to spot hidden ones—all with a single, simple button. Since there’s no game over, you can take your time without any pressure. Even if you’re not used to controllers, you’ll be just fine. And with Grandpa’s help, even high places are a piece of cake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/cc0e49b159d14c1ce94737fd45f9e1a6.poster.avif?t=1787815683\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/cc0e49b159d14c1ce94737fd45f9e1a6.webm?t=1787815683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/cc0e49b159d14c1ce94737fd45f9e1a6.mp4?t=1787815683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play your own way!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no time limit, so feel free to stroll around Kajune Land. You can try collecting every fruit for a full completion, or gather only your favorites and head straight to the goal. Find the playstyle that fits your mood each day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/5f797932278b113fd70e5694db09ebe0.poster.avif?t=1787815683\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/5f797932278b113fd70e5694db09ebe0.webm?t=1787815683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/5f797932278b113fd70e5694db09ebe0.mp4?t=1787815683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play at your own pace! (Approximate playtime)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick play: <strong>About 10 minutes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect everything: <strong>Around 60 minutes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and wander: <strong>Endless!</strong><br>Whether it’s a short break or a cozy session, <strong>it’s always Fruitimo time.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/3eb1d985f90a21bee7fa37f0a5925032.poster.avif?t=1787815683\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/3eb1d985f90a21bee7fa37f0a5925032.webm?t=1787815683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345000/extras/3eb1d985f90a21bee7fa37f0a5925032.mp4?t=1787815683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
